# 2Care.ai — Real-Time Multilingual Voice AI Agent

A real-time voice AI agent for clinical appointment booking. Patients can book, reschedule, and cancel appointments entirely through voice conversations in **English, Hindi, or Tamil** — no forms, no clicks.

![Architecture](architecture.png)

---

## Features

- **Voice-first** — speak naturally, agent responds in audio
- **Multilingual** — English, Hindi, Tamil with auto-detection
- **Full appointment lifecycle** — book, reschedule, cancel, list
- **Conflict detection** — real slot locking via PostgreSQL `FOR UPDATE`
- **Two-layer memory** — session state in Redis + permanent patient history
- **Outbound campaigns** — reminder and follow-up call support
- **Latency logging** — every turn logs STT / Agent / TTS / Total ms

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer             | Technology                     |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Backend           | Node.js + TypeScript + Express |
| Real-time         | WebSockets (ws)                |
| Speech-to-Text    | OpenAI Whisper                 |
| Intent Detection  | GPT-4o-mini (max_tokens: 20)   |
| Text-to-Speech    | OpenAI TTS (alloy / shimmer)   |
| Session Memory    | Redis (TTL 30 min)             |
| Persistent Memory | Redis (no TTL)                 |
| Appointment Data  | PostgreSQL 15                  |
| Deployment        | Docker + docker-compose        |

---

## Project Structure

```
voice-ai-agent/
├── agent/
│   ├── reasoning/agentExecutor.ts      ← State machine (core logic)
